Strumming Pattern: D UDUD

Use Down Stroke in Intro Part

[C]Heere moti mein na chahun

[F]mein to chahun..[G]..[Am]sangam teraa

[G]mein to teri [F]Saiyyan

[C]Tu hai mera

Sai [C]yaan..[G]..[Am]..[G]

Sai [Dm]yaan [C]..[F]..[G]

[F]Tu jo chhule [G]pyar se

aa [Em]ram se mar [C]jaoon [E]

[F]aaja chanda [G]baahon mein

tujh [Em]me hi gum ho [C]jaoon main

tere [G]naam mein kho [C]jaoon

Sai [C]yaan..[G]..[Am]..[G]

Sai [Dm]yaan [C]..[F]..[G]

Mere [C]dil khushi se [F]jhume gaye [C]raate

pal [C]pal mujhe [F]doobaae aate [C]jaate

tujhe [F]jeet [G]jeet [Am]haroon [G]

yeh [F]pran [G]pran [Am]varoon [G]

haaye [F]aise [G]main ni [Am]haroon [G]

teri [F]aar [G]ti [Am]utaroon [G]

tere [C]naam se [F]jude hai

saare [C]naate

Sai [C]yaan..[G]..[Am]..[G]

Sai [Dm]yaan [C]..[F]..[G]

[F]banke mala [G]prem ki tere

[Em]tan pe zhar zhar [C]jaoon [E]

[F]baithun naiya [G]preet ki

san [Em]saar se har [C]jaoon mein

tere [G]pyar se thar [C]jaoon

Sai [C]yaan..[G]..[Am]..[G]

Sai [Dm]yaan [C]..[F]..[G]

yeh [C]naram naram na [F]sha hai badhta [C]jaaye

koi [C]pyaar se ghun [F]gatiya deta [C]uthaaye

ab [F]baaw [G]raa hu [Am]aa man [G]

jag [F]ho ga [G]yaa hai [Am]roshan [G]

yeh [F]nayi [G]nayi su [Am]hagan [G]

ho ga [F]yi hai [G]teri [Am]jogan [G]

